# LockSmithPro - Professional Lockpicking Service Manager

**Transform your rogue into a profitable lockpicking business with LockSmithPro!**

LockSmithPro is a comprehensive addon designed for rogues who want to monetize their lockpicking skills efficiently. It automates customer detection, tracks earnings, manages job queues, and handles customer communication - all while you focus on picking locks and earning gold.

## Core Features

### 🎯 Intelligent Job Board
- **Automated Chat Monitoring**: Detects lockpicking requests across Trade, General, LFG, Say, and Whisper channels
- **Smart Detection**: Recognizes all major junkboxes and lockboxes through item links (works in all languages!)
- **Custom Filters**: Set include/exclude keywords to fine-tune which requests appear on your job board
- **Quick Actions**: One-click invite, whisper, or ignore directly from the dashboard
- **Skill Matching**: Automatically shows required skill vs. your current skill level
- **Session Ignore List**: Temporarily ignore customers who declined invites

### 📊 Comprehensive Statistics Tracking
- **Real-Time Earnings**: Track gold earned per session and lifetime totals
- **Job Metrics**: Monitor total jobs completed and average tips
- **Box Tracking**: Detailed statistics on boxes opened by type
- **Session History**: View best session earnings and last session performance
- **Per-Customer Tracking**: Prevents duplicate job counting from the same customer within 10 minutes

### 📢 Advertisement System
- **Customizable Messages**: Use `%SPELL_LINK%` to automatically insert your lockpicking spell link
- **Multi-Channel Support**: Advertise in Trade, General, LFG, or Yell channels
- **Auto-Timer**: Optional automatic advertising at configurable intervals
- **One-Click Manual Ads**: Send advertisements instantly with a single button

### 🤖 Automated Response System
- **Low Skill Auto-Reply**: Automatically whispers customers when your skill is too low for their box
- **Thank You Messages**: Sends customized thank-you whispers after receiving tips (use `%TIP%` placeholder)
- **Auto-Invite on Whisper**: Option to automatically invite anyone who whispers you
- **Smart Trade Detection**: Prevents duplicate popups from recent trade partners

### 🎨 Raid Marker Integration
- **Auto-Mark Self**: Automatically places a raid marker on yourself when creating a group (configurable icon)
- **Auto-Mark Customers**: Automatically marks customers with sequential raid icons when they join your group
- **Custom Icon Order**: Choose your preferred raid marker sequence for easy customer identification

### 👥 Smart Customer Management
- **Recent Trade Tracking**: Remembers last 5 trade partners to prevent "ty" whisper popups
- **Declined Invite Memory**: Won't re-spam invites to players who declined this session
- **Group Member Detection**: Automatically ignores requests from players already in your group
- **Throttle Protection**: Prevents invite spam with 30-second cooldown per customer

### ⚙️ Flexible Configuration
- **Channel Toggles**: Enable/disable monitoring for each chat channel individually
- **Popup Options**: Choose whether to show popups for any whisper or only keyword matches
- **Sound Effects**: Toggle notification sounds on/off
- **Minimap Button**: Convenient minimap button for quick access (can be hidden)
- **Dashboard Interface**: Clean, modern UI showing all active jobs, statistics, and controls

## How to Use

1. **Start LockSmithPro**: Type `/locksmith` or click the minimap button to open the dashboard
2. **Click "Start Service"**: Begins monitoring chat channels for lockpicking requests
3. **Review Job Board**: New requests appear automatically with customer name, message, and required skill
4. **Take Action**:
   - Click **Invite** to send a group invite
   - Click **Whisper** to open a conversation
   - Click **Ignore** to dismiss and block for the session
5. **Complete Jobs**: Trade with customers, receive tips, and watch your statistics grow!
6. **Advertise** (Optional): Use the "Advertise" button or enable auto-timer to promote your services

## Slash Commands

- `/locksmith` or `/ls` - Open/close the dashboard
- `/locksmith start` - Start monitoring for requests
- `/locksmith stop` - Stop monitoring
- `/locksmith ad` - Send advertisement to enabled channels
- `/locksmith reset` - Reset all statistics (requires confirmation)

